@startuml
autonumber
skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam MaxMessageSize 250
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

actor "User A" as UA
actor "User B" as UB
participant "Nginx" as NX
box "API Gateway (Orchestrator)" #LightYellow
    participant "Gateway A" as GWA
    participant "Gateway B" as GWB
end box
participant "Matching Service" as MS
participant "Question Service" as QS
participant "Editor Service" as ES
participant "Chat Service" as CS
database "Redis (Pub/Sub & State)" as RD

== Phase 1: Generic Matching ==

UA -> NX: POST /api/matching/find-pair (criteria_1_opts, criteria_2_opts, JWT)
NX -> GWA: Forward Request
GWA -> GWA: Auth: Verify JWT A
GWA -> MS: POST /find-pair (uid_A, criteria_1_opts, criteria_2_opts)

... Both users queue ...

MS -> RD: PUBLISH match_events {uid_A, uid_B, crit_1, crit_2}

== Phase 2: Distributed Session Initialization ==

RD -->> GWA: [Message Received]
RD -->> GWB: [Message Received]

GWA -> GWA: Generate sessionId_A
GWB -> GWB: Generate sessionId_B

note over GWA, GWB: Atomic Race: The first sessionId to reach Redis becomes the shared session ID, and the Gateway that obtains the lock becomes the leader.

GWA -> RD: SETNX lock:match:A:B sessionId_A
GWB -> RD: SETNX lock:match:A:B sessionId_B

RD --> GWA: 1 (Leader)
RD --> GWB: 0 (Follower)

group Leader Logic (GWA)
    GWA -> QS: GET /questions?topic=crit_1&diff=crit_2
    QS --> GWA: {qid: "q_101", ...}
    GWA -> RD: SET session:sessionId_A:meta {"users": ["A", "B"], "qid": "q_101"}
    GWA -> RD: SET session:sessionId_A:editor {"code": "", "version": 0}
    GWA -->> UA: [Notify] Match Found! {sessionId: sessionId_A}
end

group Follower Logic (GWB)
    GWB -> RD: GET lock:match:A:B
    RD --> GWB: sessionId_A (Follower retrieves winning ID)
    GWB -> RD: WAIT/POLL for session:sessionId_A:meta
    GWB -->> UB: [Notify] Match Found! {sessionId: sessionId_A}
end

== Phase 3: Specialized Collaborative Sessions ==

UA -> NX: WS Connect /socket.io/editor?sessionId=sessionId_A
NX -> GWA: Forward Upgrade
GWA -> ES: Proxy WS Upgrade (Headers: X-User-Id: uid_A)

UA -> NX: WS Connect /socket.io/chat?sessionId=sessionId_A
NX -> GWA: Forward Upgrade
GWA -> CS: Proxy WS Upgrade (Headers: X-User-Id: uid_A)

== Phase 4: Independent Real-time Sync ==

UA -> ES: WS Message: code_change (Delta)
ES -> RD: Update session:sessionId_A:editor
ES -> UB: Broadcast code_update

UA -> CS: WS Message: send_message ("Hello!")
CS -> RD: LPUSH session:sessionId_A:chat_history
CS -> UB: Broadcast receive_message
@enduml
